wasm(0010) scheduler stop — WASM-CORE-0010

TaskTracker::spawn panics on wasm32 ("there is no reactor running"):
tokio_util rides the real tokio, which has no runtime in the browser.
Gate the tracker path to native; wasm32 spawns the shutdown waits
directly onto the velta-tokio-wasm event loop.

Native impact: none — native keeps the original code path.

